			"notes": "### New Features\n* Added embedding effect (now choose between boomerang, embed, and off)\n* Embedding includes a bleeding effect that makes mobs lose life slowly while a weapons are embedded in them. \n* Various sound effect additions\n* Improved Aim Assist accuracy and feel\n* Added blood particle effects for hits and embedded bleeding (can be toggled)\n\n### Fixes\n* Fixed weapon damage calculations (should work with modded weapons too?)\n* Only boomerang/embed if the item is a weapon or tool"
		},
